    "title": "Back to school",
    "text": "Back to school\nMembers of the Leadership Ohio Valley Class of 2026 spent Wednesday visiting the Weirton campus of West Virginia Northern Community College, learning about the various programs and services offered through the college’s three Ohio Valley campuses. Participants heard from representatives of early access, public safety and social services programs, received demonstrations in the nursing and surgical technology classrooms, visited with students as well as the campus Applied Technology classrooms, the Academic Resource Center and more. Leadership Ohio Valley is organized by the Weirton Area Chamber of Commerce. — Craig Howell",
